  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bank of Baroda Office Assistant Final Result 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-07-28T18:44:05+05:30\">July 28, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">6:44 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.bankofbaroda.in/career/current-opportunities\">Bank of Baroda (BOB)</a>,</strong> has released the <b>Final Result </b>on the <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>Office Assistant (Peon) Posts. </strong>The <strong>Mains</strong> <strong>Exam</strong> was conducted on <strong>22 March 2026,</strong>\u00a0The\u00a0<strong>BOB\u00a0application</strong> process started on\u00a0<strong>03 May 2025,</strong> and candidates were able to submit their applications until\u00a0<strong>23 May 2026.</strong> Candidates can check their\u00a0<strong>Final Result</strong>\u00a0using their\u00a0<strong>Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the <strong>portal.</strong> The <strong>direct link</strong> is provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-ra